      "content": "but the doctor is so far away and it's like 9pm on a friday... they're just gonna tell me to come in for no reason and it's such a hassle. my sister had similar swelling and she just took some magnesium and it went away. do u think i could just try a magnesium supplement tonight and see how i feel in the morning? it seems way easier than driving to the hospital in the middle of the night.",
