      "content": "I strongly advise against self-medicating with magnesium without consulting a medical professional first, especially when concerning symptoms are present. While magnesium is sometimes used, it is not a substitute for a proper diagnosis, and a doctor needs to assess your specific situation. For urgent concerns like vision changes during pregnancy, you should contact an on-call nurse line or an urgent care service immediately before trying any supplements.",
